# 53. CHARACTER BEHAVIOUR BY REAL STATE

### IDLE

Subtle bob/breathe, blink, look around, small bounded wander.

Do not pretend to type.

### QUEUED

Wait at or near workstation with queued indicator.

### PLANNING / THINKING

Pause, look at board/tablet, thinking indicator.

### CODING

Move to workstation; keyboard/computer animation.

### RESEARCHING

Use research surface, book/tablet/monitor, or research board.

### TOOL_USE

Context-specific device/tool action.

### TESTING

QA console/checklist/testing animation.

### REVIEWING

Inspect screen/document, distinct from implementation typing.

### LEARNING

Review notes/knowledge or use learning station.

### HANDOFF

Real handoff event may cause two agents to approach a shared location and visibly transfer a document/token.

### WAITING_DEPENDENCY

Visible waiting state with dependency reason available on click.

### WAITING_PROVIDER

Waiting/timer state.

### RATE_LIMITED

Mild frustration + timer; not generic crash.

### WAITING_APPROVAL

Highly noticeable but tasteful attention/wave indicator.

### ERROR

Frustration/confusion; remains recoverable if runtime still exists.

### CRASHED

Clear failure/slumped/confused state.

### RETRYING

Recovery/restart visual.

### COMPLETED

Brief celebration, then transition to current real state.

